{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53090","headline":"芳草涧 · 韦应物","name":"芳草涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青青满地铺颜色，曲曲一湾流水声。\n总爲游人逞风景，乱云初卷碧天空。\n（见嘉靖《六合县志》卷八，上海图书馆据天一阁藏本所摄显微胶卷。\n原注出《嘉定志》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}